  "openLoop": "What happened to West Asia's largest lake?",
  "payoff": "By late 2017 it was 10% of its size; NASA shows it almost gone in September 2025; early 2026 brought a five-year high.",
  "engagementQuestion": "Can a lake this big come back?",
